						<td>Hunts, trophies, species, notes, photos and media you add</td>
						<td>Provide the core logging features and sync them across your devices</td>
						<td>Contract (6(1)(b))</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Location data</td>
						<td>Precise GPS location, map regions, areas and markers you create</td>
						<td>Center the map, place markers, and store the locations you record</td>
						<td>Contract (6(1)(b)); device location access only with your consent (6(1)(a))</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Photos &amp; media</td>
						<td>Images/videos you attach to records</td>
						<td>Let you document hunts and trophies</td>
