						<td>Let you add hunting companions and contacts</td>
						<td>Consent (6(1)(a)) — only contacts you actively import</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Subscription &amp; payment data</td>
						<td>Subscription status, plan, Stripe customer/subscription identifiers, billing history</td>
						<td>Manage your subscription and usage limits</td>
						<td>Contract (6(1)(b)); legal obligation for accounting (6(1)(c))</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Diagnostics</td>
						<td>Crash logs and technical error data (via Firebase Crashlytics)</td>
						<td>Keep the app stable and fix bugs</td>
						<td>Legitimate interests (6(1)(f)) — maintaining a reliable service</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>Push notifications</td>
						<td>Device push token (via Firebase Cloud Messaging)</td>
						<td>Send notifications you've enabled</td>
						<td>Consent (6(1)(a))</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
		<p>We do <strong>not</strong> use your data for advertising, and we do <strong>not</strong> track you across other companies' apps or websites.</p>

		<h2>4. Payment processing (Stripe)</h2>
		<p>Subscriptions are processed by <strong>Stripe</strong>, not through Apple or Google. When you subscribe, your card and billing details are collected and processed directly by Stripe as an independent controller/processor under <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stripe's privacy policy</a>. We do not receive or store your full card number. We store your subscription status and Stripe identifiers to manage your access and usage limits.</p>

		<h2>5. Who we share data with</h2>
		<p>We share personal data only with service providers ("processors") that help us run TrophyLog, under data processing agreements:</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Railway</strong> — application hosting and database</li>
			<li><strong>Google Firebase</strong> (Crashlytics, Cloud Messaging) — crash diagnostics and push notifications</li>
			<li><strong>Mapbox</strong> — map rendering (receives location/map requests)</li>
			<li><strong>Stripe</strong> — payment processing</li>
			<li><strong>Google / Apple</strong> — only if you use Sign in with Google/Apple, for authentication</li>
		</ul>
		<p>We do not sell your personal data.</p>

		<h2>6. International transfers</h2>
		<p>Some of our processors (e.g. Google, Stripe, Mapbox) may process data outside the EU/EEA, including in the United States. Where this happens, transfers are protected by appropriate safeguards such as the EU Standard Contractual Clauses and/or the EU–US Data Privacy Framework. Contact us for details or a copy of the safeguards.</p>

		<h2>7. How long we keep data</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Account and hunting content:</strong> for as long as your account is active, and deleted within 30 days after you delete your account.</li>
			<li><strong>Subscription/billing records:</strong> kept for 5 years where required by Danish accounting law (Bogføringsloven).</li>
			<li><strong>Crash diagnostics:</strong> retained per Firebase defaults (up to 90 days).</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>8. Your rights under GDPR</h2>
		<p>You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict, or object to processing, to data portability, and to withdraw consent at any time (without affecting prior processing). To exercise any right, contact <a href="mailto:contact@trophylog.com">contact@trophylog.com</a>. You can delete your account and associated data directly in the app under <strong>Settings → Delete account</strong>, or by emailing us.</p>
		<p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Danish Data Protection Agency (<strong>Datatilsynet</strong>, <a href="https://www.datatilsynet.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">datatilsynet.dk</a>).</p>

		<h2>9. Children</h2>
		<p>TrophyLog is not directed at children under 16. We do not knowingly collect data from children under that age.</p>

		<h2>10. Changes</h2>
		<p>We may update this policy. Material changes will be notified in the app or by email. The "Last updated" date reflects the latest version.</p>

		<h2>11. Contact</h2>
		<p>TrophyLog A/S, Sortebjergvej 6, 3200 Helsinge, Denmark — <a href="mailto:contact@trophylog.com">contact@trophylog.com</a></p>
	</Fragment>

